    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mission:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Exterminate the self-replicating robots that are now infesting an experimental research facility before they become too strong - or find their way out.<br></li><li>Look really cool while doing it.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resources:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A personal Gravity-Manipulation device.<br></li><li>A powerful weapon of your choice, and an infinite ammo-generator for it.<br></li><li>An emergency shotgun.<br></li><li>A small personal shielding device.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Threats:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Powerful robots.<br></li><li>Terrifying lab experiments and machines.<br></li><li>The ground - AVOID AT ALL COSTS!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You may be able to salvage experimental devices to give yourself an edge in combat.<br></li><li>Extra rewards may be earned by collecting important samples from the labs.</li></ul><br>Good luck out there.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966160/extras/4f3d87f1d93b8a2fa8dcb7377f92260a.poster.avif?t=1718100573\" width=450 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966160/extras/4f3d87f1d93b8a2fa8dcb7377f92260a.webm?t=1718100573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966160/extras/4f3d87f1d93b8a2fa8dcb7377f92260a.mp4?t=1718100573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
